# *Tay-Sachs Disease*

@left

- 95% of all the alleles in the population are _wildtype_, but 5% of the alleles are the recessive allele which causes Tay-Sachs disease.
- Assuming H-W, what frequency of the population would you expect to suffer from Tay-Sachs disease?

