- q^2^ = 0.10
- q = sqrt(0.1) = 0.316
- p = 1-q = 0.684
- 2pq = 2\*0.316\*0.684 = 0.43
- f = 2pq/(p^2^+2pq) = 2pq/(1&#8211;q^2^)
- f = 0.43/0.9 = 0.48

