=== layout: one-panel

# *Example\: A-B-O Blood Type*

@body

- The A-B-O blood types are determined by three alleles, _IA, IB,_ and _I_, with frequencies _p, q,_ and _r,_ respectively.
- Genotypes can be calculated by expanding the trinomial
  - (_p_ + _q_ + _r_)2 = _p^2^_ + _q^2^_ + _r_2 + 2_pq_ + 2_qr_ + 2_pr_

=== layout: one-panel
@replaceme


@body

- [*Blood Type*]{underline=true}	[*Genotype*]{underline=true}	[*Frequency*]{underline=true}
- 	A		_IAIA_			_p^2^_
- 			_IAi_			2_pr_
- 	B		_IBIB_			_q^2^_
- 			_IBi_			2_qr_
- 	AB		_IAIB_			2_pq_
- 	O		_ii_			_r_2

